{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/Steam_Gif.gif?t=1749238335\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survive the speedy ride!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/steam_banners_01_EN.png?t=1749238335\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to protect your car as an overzealous tow truck hurls you through the streets: Get dragged, tossed, launched through the air, and slammed into obstacles while trying to keep your car under control!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/steam_banners_03.png?t=1749238335\" /></div><br>Once you're hooked, the tow truck mercilessly drags you along. You can briefly break free from the cable to steer on your own - but don\u2019t stay unhooked too long, or the tow truck will leave you behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/steam_banners_02.png?t=1749238335\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tackle a variety of tracks, from bustling city streets to winding highways, and try to reach the garage without wrecking your car (even more). Hunt for shortcuts and hidden secrets - but don\u2019t unhook for too long, or you\u2019re not going anywhere!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690870?t=1749238335","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690870?t=1749238335","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/ee448